  "content": "<p>这是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics Of Gaming</a>模组的延续，添加了来自游戏中的著名武器，兼容<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a>，也可在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frelics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>上找到。</p><hr><p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mdC9G7T.png\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s7PQ4T0.png\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fskfb.ly%252foMEVr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://skfb.ly/oMEVr 吉他</a></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Em37ORK.png\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fskfb.ly%252fooYRG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://skfb.ly/ooYRG 破坏剑</a></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Foxe4At.png\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fskfb.ly%252fooVwT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://skfb.ly/ooVwT 兽王剑</a></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KzDjs6T.png\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hflh9Zq.png\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oxj7IIW.png\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FKiZ4bP.png\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WTixPVW.png\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EmeZ4hj.png\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y1qhfYO.png\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q6PYO8T.png\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kGz8N2B.png\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DXonWLI.gif\" alt=\"Gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\"></p><p>我不知道如何将实体添加为obj模型</p><hr><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tB9syjC.png\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KGJwxC2.png\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"htt